        "WebSocket ctor creates one provider CTS and SocketModel(handle0). Provider CTS.CancelAfter(new TimeSpan(0,0,100))=100seconds fromproviderconstruction, used only ConnectAsync; send/receive/close use CancellationToken.None. ServerURL string.Format({0}:{1}/, appSettingsServerUri,port); installed config ServerUri=wss://127.0.0.1 andexplicitportlist below. UserSettings mayoverride installeddefaults.",
        "ConnectAsync returns true immediately if wsConnection!=null without socketstatecheck. Else launchconnectServerAsync foreachconfiguredport concurrently, discard Task.WhenAll awaitresult and poll Task.Delay100milliseconds untilconnection!=null or all taskcompleted. Each worker createsClientWebSocket,awaitsconnect thenhandshake; catchobject silently ignores failure; no explicit disposal of failedsockets or providerCTS. No priorityguarantee fromportlistorder.",
        "Handshake sends CN000001 apiArgs{name:PCS Data Viewer,maxNum:nullableDouble1},then readsone response. ResultInfo.Result==0 installs cws onlyif wsConnection stillnull, otherwiseCloseOutputAsync1000/end on redundantwinner;ret=true afterthat. Nonzero/nullresponse returnsfalse; parse/connect failures swallowed. No requestID/freeMsg equalityvalidation observed.",
        "ReceiveEventBase RequestID=DateTime.Now.ToString(yyyyMMddhhmmssfff)+SerialNumber.GetAndAdd().ToString(0000). Counter returns priorvalue, increments static unsynchronized integer then resets0 when newvalue>=9999. CreateCommand common{apiId:GetApiId(),ack:nullableint0},free{freeMsg:RequestID}.",
        "CN000002 challenge request has nullapiArgs;success stores apiArgs.challengeCode into model. CN000003 auth apiArgs.authenticationCode=uppercasehex(SHA256(UTF8(challenge+fixed literal LsXw35kZ6EH33QjFHthh))); null/empty challenge hashes to emptystring (no SHA computation). Authwrapper returns raw ResultInfo.Result,default-1 oncaughtfailure.",
