        "ReceiveEvent storesresult then dispatchessuccess iff nonnull and ResultInfo.Result==0,otherwisefailure; missingResultInfo canthrow. Wrapper bodies catchobject andretain defaults/heldmodels. Eachwrapper sendscommand then consumesnextone receivedresponse; SendAsync bool isdiscarded bycallingwrapper. No APIID/requestID correspondencecheck beyondDeserializer dispatch.",
        "Serializer DataContractJsonSerializer UseSimpleDictionaryFormat=true; exactJSONnames andEmitDefaultValue flags fromattrs below. SerializeJsonObject andconvert catch Exception, log4net.Error andreturn currentstring(initialempty). convert stripsregex \"__type\":[^,}]+(,|(?=})) globally. UTF8text send,endOfMessage=true. SendAsync catchesobject=>false,elsescuccess true even emptyserializedpayload sent.",
