    {
      "id": "DataCaptureReports.vehicle_diagnostic_report.current_print_pipeline",
      "classification": "current-source-proof",
      "ordered_behavior": [
        "VehicleDiagnosticReport(commonInfo) retains CommonInfo only. print(printData,printBeforeCallback) derives baseUrl=document.baseURI up to last slash, opens loader, sequentially createPrintFrame,setPrintHeader,setScreenImage,setPrintData,optional callback.then(callBrowsersPrint) else direct callBrowsersPrint; finally closes loader on success/rejection. No catch converts failure into success. callback must return thenable; rejection prevents browser print.",
        "createPrintFrame appends hidden iframe src=baseUrl+/view/+printData.template, width=window.innerWidth numeric/style; awaits load deferred (no onerror/timeout), adds afterprint handler remove iframe; for each cssList sequentially load link baseUrl+/styles/+css and await its load (no error path). It does not re-fetch captured ECU data or compose tables.",
        "setPrintHeader GtsWorkerApi.getLocaleFormat()->send(getLocaleFormat)->WorkerController.getLocaleFormat resolves gts.util.dateFormatId. Reads CURRENT DOM status spans #s_pane_vn/#s_pane_mlg/#s_pane_vt for spec/mileage/VIN, not printData fields and not direct commonInfo captured vehicle metadata. #s_pane_date text truthy -> resource r_item_i2118 + space-hyphen + substring from last space; else empty. User label r_item_i3246 + colon-space + commonInfo.userInfo.userName.",
        "getFormatedDate creates local now with padded month/day/hour/min/sec and locale index 1:YYYY/MM/DD,2:YYYY/DD/MM,3:MM/YYYY/DD,4:MM/DD/YYYY,5:DD/YYYY/MM,6:DD/MM/YYYY plus HH:mm:ss; 0 empty; unsupported index undefined. No date-format fallback.",
        "setScreenImage creates nested iframe src=baseUrl+/view/vehicle_diagnostic_report/s_vehiclediagnosticreport_template_image.html in #vdr_screenImage, numeric width/style width,height from viewport (misspelled heigth property also assigned). If width>1560 applies scale(1560/width),transformOrigin0 0. Awaits load, appends base href=baseUrl, then sequentially awaits cloning each document.head LINK rel stylesheet except names containing main_print.css or health_check_print.css.",
        "Clones every document.body child except IFRAME and .modal-backdrop into screen iframe. For cloned #main_pane removes #modal_dialog via querySelector(...).remove() without null guard. This is cloned DOM snapshot, not raster screenshot; form/canvas/iframe/browser clone behavior not enhanced by shared printer. Does not execute network/client by this analysis.",
        "setPrintData iterates printData.partsList, appends each actual parts.element into print iframe target #parentNodeId (moves supplied node, does not clone here). Iterates querySelectorAll literal [class*=\"r_item_\" and finds first class beginning r_item_, sets element.innerHTML=gts.util.getResourceItem(className). No data escaping/sanitization or inferred report schema beyond supplied DOM.",
        "callBrowsersPrint calls printFrame.contentWindow.print() then resolves immediately; afterprint removes outer frame. Loader finally close is not print-completion acknowledgment. If error before afterprint no explicit frame cleanup; no retry/cancel worker API. Browser print UI cancel is native browser behavior, no custom cancel callback here. No upload/save/delete request in this helper other than locale worker read."
      ],
      "payload": {
        "template": "view-relative HTML member string",
        "cssList": "ordered styles-relative path strings",
        "partsList": "ordered {parentNodeId,element:DOM Node} moved into print frame",
        "printBeforeCallback": "optional function(printFrame)->Promise; after report and screenshot DOM built, before window.print"
      },
      "proof": ["persistence.rm.gui.90aae055dc5f151f", "persistence.rm.gui.5b4e33e75c293050"]
    },
    {
      "id": "DataCaptureReports.vehicle_diagnostic_report.older_controller_modal_pipeline",
      "classification": "current-source-proof",
      "ordered_behavior": [
        "Older VehiclediagnosticreportController constructor owns commonInfo/dispatcher/modalView:null. init simply invokes showSVehiclediagnosticreportDl001(this) without initializing modalView or printData, and returns no promise. This cannot be promoted as working advertised entrypoint; no new VehiclediagnosticreportController call is present in authenticated application JS scanned for exact constructor use. Bodies nevertheless retained as shipped frontend semantics.",
        "print(printData) reads printData.template.file/elementId, ViewUtil.getView -> elementList[0], injects printData.html.data as innerHTML under #printData.html.elementId; builds _printData id:test, dialog shopInformation checked/enabled, screenImage checked with misspelled didabled:false, report.data checked/enabled message r_item_i0250, note.message r_item_i3227, report.data=selected DOM element, css=printData.css, templete:file. Creates modalView, awaits showSV... then directly triggers ViewEvent.OK_BTN (controller print/dispose), not the view checkbox-hide handler.",
        "showSV... creates printInfo from CURRENT commonInfo: oemType,destination,vehicleType,modelYear,engineType,vehicleName,VIN,mileage,dealerInformation,userName,dashboard productionDate,printDate. getFormatedDate returns fixed index1 YYYY/MM/DD HH:mm:ss (unused table alternatives include dt.yedayar typo). Calls modalView.initView(printInfo,printData), caches returned printPage (view resolves undefined), registers OK/CANCEL listeners. Catch rejects with undefined, dropping reason.",
        "OK controller calls modalView.showPrintPage()->contentWindow.print(), disposes view and nulls it. Cancel disposes/nulls without print. View Cancel itself removes iframe before dispatch; OK afterprint removes iframe. No controller dispatcher dispose method or work-request cancellation supplied.",
        "View init awaits createPrintPage before loading modal template; static no-keyboard modal. Sets shopInformation/screenImage disabled,checked from printData.dialog; builds report checkbox for each report key and optional subItem with disabled,checked,message classes and data-chained/data-parent. note.message from input is not applied dynamically; template fixed note r_item_i3227.",
        "updatePrintPage loops .vdr_checkBox; any data-chained child disabled/unchecked/lightgray when parent unchecked; when parent checked enables/normal label (regardless original disabled). OK enabled iff ANY checkbox checked, even disabled checked. Changes do not hide iframe content yet; OK click hides each corresponding iframe #vdr_... only when unchecked, then dispatches OK; missing matching element is not guarded.",
        "createPrintPage outer hidden iframe src view/vehicle_diagnostic_report/s_vehiclediagnosticreport_001.html; nested screen iframe srcdoc <!DOCTYPE html>, viewport sizing; await outer load; afterprint remove outer; clone Bootstrap and report CSS, plus optional printData.css using cloned Bootstrap link and custom href (custom rel not preserved). No CSS load awaits. Vehicle spec: (!DS4 && destination NA1)||(DS4 && destination JP3) -> modelYear vehicleName engine; else vehicleName vehicleType engine. Header uses supplied printInfo, mileage raw value+unit, production label r_item_i3228 and user label r_item_i3229; uses innerHTML.",
        "For each printData.report key cloneNode(true), set id vdr_key and append to report. First r_item_ class redraw. Nested screen iframe awaited after append, then clones all head LINK except href contains main_print.css or health_check_print (broader substring than current helper), then clones all body childNodes except IFRAME, including modal/backdrop state as present. No max-width transform or clone modal removal in older helper.",
        "disposeView removes body.modal-open and all .modal-backdrop, calls unrelated #v_datalogger_manager.modal(hide), empties #modal_dialog and dispatcher. No retry/error UI beyond inherited initView.catch(onErrorCommon); frames can remain on failures."
      ],
      "proof": ["persistence.rm.gui.0ffe5322c48c3721", "persistence.rm.gui.a7b5865945801e05", "persistence.rm.gui.0677802861844355"]
    },
