        "Failed ECU-status check or save falls into final return conversion; no extra failure result synthesized.",
        "Stored translation uses shared deferred PFResourceForStored; original cache.language passed but helper signature uses current userLanguage.",
        "Conversion failure re-enters createReturnValue from catch and can reject on the same malformed cache."
